editor_description = "The firelight: it stands in the hearth's mouth, so the jambs and the lintel shape what it reaches, and it throws the room's shadows. Little of it goes into the fog, or the hearth's mouth fills with glare. (Curfew hangs the taproom's talk on it.)"

